  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "If each model in your army has **HERETIC ASTARTES** or **CHAOS KNIGHTS**, you may recruit **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** units whatever your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), with these limits:\n\n- Their combined points: up to 250 at Incursion, 500 at Strike Force or 750 at Onslaught.\n- None of the allied models may be **WARLORD** or take Enhancements.\n- For each of **KHORNE**, **TZEENTCH**, **NURGLE** and **SLAANESH**, the daemon units with that keyword that are not **BATTLELINE** can't outnumber the **BATTLELINE** ones with it.",
